   <narrative xml:lang="EN">R&#xE9;ponse rapide aux &#xE9;pid&#xE9;mies de chol&#xE9;ra dans la province de Sud-Kivu</narrative>
  </title>
  <description type="1">
   <narrative xml:lang="EN">The main objective of this project is to provide health assistance to vulnerable communities affected by cholera in the DRC. This WHO project provides medical treatment for patients, trains health personnel, and supports disease surveillance, among other activities. The project provides life-saving humanitarian assistance to 119,454 people, including 37,030  women, 34,641 men, and 47,783  children.</narrative>
  </description>
